    {
      "en": ": VERY MERRY CHERRY BERRY PRINCE AND PRINCESS PARFAIT. FIVE TYPES OF BERRY. LOVE. KISS. eat.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
