    {
      "en": ": What the fuck is this?...What’s going on?!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": IS THERE A PROBLEM?? THE RED IS JUST RASPBERRY. YOU SHOULD BE USED TO IT BY NOW.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re not Chika...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": YOU’RE NOT RIN.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": YOU NEVER WERE.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": YOUR thoughts belong to anyone but you. YOU are a product of what has happened and will happen. EAT.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": i made it for YOU and you are still UNGRATEFUL. BITCH.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": WHY WAIT UNTIL now TO FEEL and ACT? I HAVE DONE SO MUCH but it is your skin that turns translucent while mine absorbs the endless heat of RA. CHOP THE MONK.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei...please tell me you’re not also-",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
