      "alt": "rinmeetsthehole5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am. But I think Chika brings up a good point, Rin. You should do what you’re told and conform like the rest of us. It’s in your blood.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But maybe you are broken because you have lost too much lol. Either way, gotta admit, it looks delicious.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Itadakimaaaaaaasu!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
