      "alt": "rinmeetsthehole9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Mm?...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Rin Rokuhara — congratulations.",
      "spk": "Voice Over PA",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Your attendance is not requested for the Transpacific Sadness Symposium in one year, nine days, seventeen hours, eleven minutes, and two seconds.",
      "spk": "Voice Over PA",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rinmeetsthehole10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rinmeetsthehole10.webp",
      "alt": "rinmeetsthehole10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A...dream?...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You are not dreaming. Not this time, at least.",
      "spk": "Voice Over PA",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rinmeetsthehole11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rinmeetsthehole11.webp",
      "alt": "rinmeetsthehole11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But you have dreamt so much in the past. And it is a past that has brought you here.",
      "spk": "Voice Over PA",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You have been an exemplary case study on stubborn persistence and what it takes to rob oneself of all of the joys this world has to offer.",
      "spk": "Voice Over PA",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": For that, we award you this — an endless sea of black shaped into a sensory deprivation tank where you can finally feel at home.",
      "spk": "Voice Over PA",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please enjoy [[ONE FREE WORLD], meticulously crafted to fit your standards, expectations, and hopes or lack thereof.",
      "spk": "Voice Over PA",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The weather is nothing. The time is nothing. Even this voice is nothing.",
      "spk": "Voice Over PA",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thank you for reminding us that there are some things that should never get past quality control.",
      "spk": "Voice Over PA",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Goodbye.",
      "spk": "Voice Over PA",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What the fuck was that about?...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
