    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rinmeetsthehole14.webp",
      "alt": "rinmeetsthehole14"
    },
    {
      "en": ": You don’t have to listen to her.",
      "spk": "Onund, God of the Hole",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rinmeetsthehole13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rinmeetsthehole13.webp",
      "alt": "rinmeetsthehole13"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rinmeetsthehole15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rinmeetsthehole15.webp",
      "alt": "rinmeetsthehole15"
    },
    {
      "en": ": There is always another way.",
      "spk": "Onund, God of the Hole",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rinmeetsthehole13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rinmeetsthehole13.webp",
      "alt": "rinmeetsthehole13"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rinmeetsthehole16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rinmeetsthehole16.webp",
      "alt": "rinmeetsthehole16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A...talking onahole?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s what I’m dreaming of now? That’s what my life has become?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am more than just a toy.",
      "spk": "Onund, God of the Hole",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am a god.",
      "spk": "Onund, God of the Hole",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": One that has grown substantially in recent days.",
      "spk": "Onund, God of the Hole",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Soon, I will look just like you.",
      "spk": "Onund, God of the Hole",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You do kind of remind me of my friend Kirin, now that you mention it.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I know the name.",
      "spk": "Onund, God of the Hole",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": An excellent perfomer, she was.",
      "spk": "Onund, God of the Hole",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": William spoke so highly of her.",
      "spk": "Onund, God of the Hole",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": William?...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Another like me. But completely unlike me.",
      "spk": "Onund, God of the Hole",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Eske would drool for you.",
      "spk": "Onund, God of the Hole",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You could collect it, bathe in it, and look this way forever.",
      "spk": "Onund, God of the Hole",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Growing. Never grown.",
      "spk": "Onund, God of the Hole",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Impressive for your age.",
      "spk": "Onund, God of the Hole",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If only you had something to fill me with.",
      "spk": "Onund, God of the Hole",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rinmeetsthehole17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rinmeetsthehole17.webp",
      "alt": "rinmeetsthehole17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But you possess nothing of value.",
      "spk": "Onund, God of the Hole",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The Fruit Fly’s Wing would never stop fluttering in your delicate hands.",
      "spk": "Onund, God of the Hole",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The what now?...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My gift.",
      "spk": "Onund, God of the Hole",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We all have at least one.",
      "spk": "Onund, God of the Hole",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We all want you to want us.",
      "spk": "Onund, God of the Hole",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But we need your love.",
      "spk": "Onund, God of the Hole",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And yours always goes away at the most inconvenient times.",
      "spk": "Onund, God of the Hole",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you know where you are?",
      "spk": "Onund, God of the Hole",
      "spkColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Inside of my head again, I imagine. Just in a...much more realistic way than normal.",
